          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:16.00" defaultTabSize="72"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="10.0" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">只在有声模仿说话上训练过的解码器，对默说（mimed speech）同样能合成（r = 0.82±0.03，与有声条件无统计差异），参与者还反馈默说更省力。</span></p>
