          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:16.00" defaultTabSize="72"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="11.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">合成的是他自己的声音。参与者用它报告：听到自己的声音「made me feel happy and it felt like my real voice」。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
