          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(15, 58, 87, 1)" fontSize="13" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">声音同时传递情绪、强调、语调与说话方式——所以 speech BCI 的目标从 text output 转向 natural communication。</span></strong></p>
        </content>
